AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "https://www.jacionline.org/article/S0091-6749(02)91343-6/fulltext") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017364> "POEMS syndrome is associated with plasmacytomas and osteosclerotic lesions. The etiologic factors of this constellation of diseases are not well defined, but radiation therapy to localized lesions is often of benefit, and there is a report that autologous hematopoetic cell transplantation benefited a patient with refractory disease.")
