# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017447> (obsolete congenital absence/hypoplasia of thumb)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:294988") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017447> "OBSOLETE. Congenital absence/hypoplasia of thumb is a rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by underdevelopment of the thumb, ranging from a slight decrease in thumb size to complete absence of the thumb. The malformation may occur isolated, combined to other defects of the hand or upper limb, or as part of a multiple congenital anomaly syndrome.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "MONDO:excludePhenotype") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000231> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017447> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0001000>)
