AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:295110") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017506> "OBSOLETE. Congenital absence/hypoplasia of thumb, unilateral is a rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by the unilateral underdevelopment of the thumb, ranging from a slight decrease in thumb size to complete absence of the thumb.")
