AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:295112") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0017507> "OBSOLETE. Congenital absence/hypoplasia of thumb, bilateral is a rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by bilateral underdevelopment of the thumbs, ranging from a slight decrease in thumb size to complete absence of the thumbs. This anomaly counts for 20-60% of thumb hypoplasias.")
